{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月11日，Anthropic行政總裁達裏奧·阿莫代伊（Dario Amodei）在公司IPO路演視頻中表示，癌症、阿爾茨海默病、心臟病及精神疾病等重大疾病，在不到10年內可能成為過去。他認為，如果AI技術得到妥善應用，人類有望迎來一個解決困擾文明數千年難題的「奇蹟時代」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585944.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:36:44.650925+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:20:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:29:50.486658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:29:50.486658+00:00","content_hash":"4bd1e671899ee1231462f5ba4360bf74f6614b99219778ec281ce51b8b2c9669","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}